  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">raod of 135 m, as a part of the regional road from South to North, starts in Garcia city (Nino) to mudgash city, then in thefuture it will reach Wajir city, then to Mandira city, on the Ethiopian borders.</narrative>
